@startuml SEQ_02_REGISTER
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-02: Register

actor       "Publik"                   as Publik
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "RegisteredUserController" as Controller
entity      "User Model"               as Model
database    "users"                    as DB

== Buka Halaman Register ==

Publik  -> Browser    : Akses /register
Browser -> Controller : GET /register
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman register
Browser --> Publik    : Tampil form registrasi

== Register ==

Publik  -> Browser    : Isi name, email, password, klik Register
Browser -> Controller : POST /register {name, email, password}
Controller -> Model   : User::create({name, email, password})
Model -> DB           : INSERT INTO users
DB --> Model          : Data user baru
Model --> Controller  : Data user baru
Controller --> Browser : Redirect ke halaman Dashboard
Browser --> Publik    : Masuk halaman Dashboard

@enduml
